ory disease if acute)"], "excluded_candidates": ["Exertion-triggered acute cholecystitis: pain typically localized to RUQ but shock more common in perforated/gangrenous cases", "Acute mesenteric ischemia: risk factors include alcoholism and recent weight loss, but less likely in young female without cardiovascular history", "Ruptured ectopic pregnancy despite oral contraceptives: β-hCG pending, but RUQ pain less typical than lower abdominal presentation"], "alarm_features": ["Hypotension (80/40 mmHg) with tachycardia (110/min) indicating hemodynamic instability", "Severe localized right upper quadrant tenderness with diffuse abdominal pain"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Gynecological Emergency with Hemorrhagic Potential", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.176, "danger": 0.9, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Acute Inflammatory Biliary Tract Disease", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.4845, "posterior": 0.4845, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.75, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Acute Pancreatic Disease", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.201, "danger": 0.75, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": []}, "B4": {"id": "B4", "label": "Chronic Hepatic Vascular Disease with Acute Decompensation", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.004, "danger": 0.65, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": []}}, "frontier": ["B2", "B1", "B3", "B4"], "other_mass": 0.0, "pending_results": [], "actions_taken": [{"t": 4, "type": "ANALYZE_VIGNETTE", "content": "Does the combination of c